      "body": "Mahindra & Mahindra Limited (NSEI:M&M) executed a share purchase agreement to acquire an additional 16% stake in Carnot Technologies Private Limited for INR 67.2 million on April 27, 2026. Mahindra & Mahindra Limited acquired 5,608 shares constituting 28.03% of total paid up equity capital of Carnot Technologies Private Limited for INR 67.2 million. Upon completion of the said transaction, the Company’s holding in Carnot would increase to 80.72% of the paid-up equity share capital and collectively 89% in terms of voting rights. Carnot would continue to be the subsidiary of the company.\r\n\r\nFor the period ending March 31, 2026, Carnot Technologies Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 198 million and net income of INR 11.7 million. As of March 31, 2026, Carnot Technologies Private Li",
