      "id": "9456cf93-5234-4fab-9b5e-e6a931c9373a",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-03-09T23:07:18.000Z",
      "title": "M&M: New Maharashtra Mega Facility Will Define Next Phase Of Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have adjusted their price target on Mahindra & Mahindra slightly lower, from ₹4,320.29 to ₹4,314.29, reflecting updated assumptions around the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins, and future P/E expectations. What's in the News Mahindra Group plans to set up its largest integrated automobile and tractor manufacturing facility in Nagpur, Maharashtra, across 1,500 acres, with a 150 acre supplier park in Sambhajinagar and a planned capacity of over 5 million vehicles and 1 million tractors annually, supported by a ₹15,000 million investment over 10 years in Maharashtra (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/automobiles/nse-m-m/mahindra-mahindra-shares/qo2p8x3v-india-manufacturing-partnerships-and-ev-momentum-will-drive-future-upside/updates/22-analysts-have-adjusted-their-price-target-on-mahindra-and-mahi",
