    {
      "id": "cb3cb4bb-bd1a-45b7-abf4-f06b05b45ba8",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-12T12:33:39.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹41.85 (vs ₹28.51 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹41.85 (up from ₹28.51 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹529.6b (up 26% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹46.7b (up 47% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.8% (up from 7.6% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 1.4% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 8.9% growth forecast for the Auto industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 38% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
