      "title": "M&M: Upcoming Life Insurance Venture Will Define Next Phase Of Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have inched up their price target for Mahindra & Mahindra to ₹4,218 from about ₹4,216, citing slightly adjusted assumptions around discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E as the key drivers of this small change. What's in the News Mahindra & Mahindra introduced the Mahindra Thar Roxx Star Edition, a special edition of its five door Thar Roxx, offered in three variants with ex showroom prices between ₹1.685 million and ₹1.835 million, across diesel manual, turbo petrol automatic, and diesel automatic powertrains (Product related announcement).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/automobiles/nse-m-m/mahindra-mahindra-shares/qo2p8x3v-india-manufacturing-partnerships-and-ev-momentum-will-drive-future-upside/updates/20-analysts-have-inched-up-their-price-target-for-mahindra-and-ma",
