      "date": "2026-01-29T00:01:28.000Z",
      "title": "Mahindra & Mahindra Limited's (NSE:M&M) Business Is Trailing The Market But Its Shares Aren't",
      "body": "When close to half the companies in India have price-to-earnings ratios (or \"P/E's\") below 22x, you may consider...",
